# The Social Engineering window (see socialwin.c) and what a change of models costs. Every model can be chosen (give_techs_all). Police
# State is chosen: the energy box shows the upheaval's cost (in red) and OK asks the faction to pay it: "Never mind" (the default)
# leaves the window up, "Pay 8 energy credits" pays it and ends the window. Opened again, the faction's models are Police State and
# going back to the first model costs less than what was paid: the energy box shows what comes back (in green), and OK takes it back.
# With almost no energy credits (poked) a change that costs more than the faction has is refused by a pop-up that leaves the window
# up; with the faction's rules flag for the aliens set (poked) the question is the aliens' own. A place in the window is
# (111 + x, 203 + y).
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
